(8.5 Plant Care Guide Module) Tj
T* (Provides beginner-friendly guidance on watering, lighting, common plant problems, and simple maintenance practices.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.6 Community Module) Tj
T* (Offers a dedicated space where plant lovers can post updates, share their plant journey, and interact through a simple feed.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.7 Authentication Module) Tj
T* (Provides basic sign-up and sign-in functionality for personalized usage.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (9. TECHNOLOGIES USED) Tj
T* (Frontend:) Tj
T* (- React.js) Tj
T* (- React Router) Tj
T* (- CSS) Tj
T* (- React Icons) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Backend:) Tj
T* (- Node.js) Tj
T* (- Express.js) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Database:) Tj
T* (- MongoDB) Tj
T* (- Mongoose) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Other Tools:) Tj
T* (- Axios) Tj
T* (- Vite) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (10. SYSTEM WORKING) Tj
T* (The user opens the PlantNest application and browses the available plants. Using search, filters, and sorting options, the user can quickly find suitable plants. The user can add plants to the wishlist or buy them directly through the checkout page. The order is then stored and displayed in the orders section. Users can also access the plant care guide to understand basic maintenance steps. In addition, users can visit the community page to share updates and interact with other plant lovers.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (11. ADVANTAGES OF THE PROJECT) Tj
T* (- User friendly and visually engaging interface.) Tj
T* (- Combines shopping, learning, and community interaction in one platform.) Tj
T* (- Beginner-friendly guidance for plant maintenance.) Tj
T* (- Organized browsing with filters and sorting features.) Tj
T* (- Encourages engagement and emotional connection through the community space.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (12. LIMITATIONS) Tj
T* (- The current authentication system is basic and can be improved.) Tj
T* (- The community feature currently uses lightweight local storage behavior and can be extended with shared database support.) Tj
T* (- Online payment gateway integration is not fully implemented.) Tj
T* (- Admin management features are not included in the current version.) Tj
T* () Tj
ET

