(13. FUTURE ENHANCEMENTS) Tj
T* (- Add secure user authentication and authorization.) Tj
T* (- Implement real-time community chat and commenting.) Tj
T* (- Add admin dashboard for managing plants, users, and orders.) Tj
T* (- Integrate online payment gateways.) Tj
T* (- Add image upload support for community posts.) Tj
T* (- Add recommendation features based on plant care level and user interest.) Tj
T* (- Enable shared community posts using backend database storage.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (14. CONCLUSION) Tj
T* (PlantNest is a practical and modern web application that goes beyond a normal plant store by creating a complete ecosystem for plant lovers. It combines e-commerce, education, and community engagement in one platform. The project is especially useful for beginners who need support in selecting and maintaining plants, while also providing an enjoyable space for experienced plant enthusiasts to share their journey. PlantNest demonstrates how technology can be used to build a meaningful, user-centered digital experience.) Tj
ET

